# ── Signing ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Standard Android .gitignore templates include "*.keystore", which silently
# drops the signing key and makes the release build fail with
# "Keystore file not found". This app is a personal sideloaded APK, so the
# key is committed on purpose. Force-include both forms:
!android/app/naada-release.keystore
!android/app/naada-keystore.b64
